{% comment %}
  Sharing a post, in its header under the date line: copy the link, the system's share sheet where there is one (a
  phone; shown by assets/js/share.js) and plain links to the networks' own share pages, without their scripts or
  trackers. The glyphs are Font Awesome Free 6.6.0 (icons CC BY 4.0, https://fontawesome.com/license/free) as SVG.
{% endcomment %}
